{"tuid":"3myqnrs64nbtwdaz","pageVersion":18,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2026-04-14"},"identification":{"ifids":["ZCODE-5-041231-9408"],"bafn":2442,"format":"zcode"},"bibliographic":{"title":"The Dreamhold","author":"Andrew Plotkin","language":"en","firstpublished":"2004","genre":"Fantasy","description":"<i>The Dreamhold</i> is interactive fiction — a classic text adventure. No graphics! No point-and-click! You type your commands, and read what happens next. <br> <br><i>The Dreamhold</i> is designed for people who have never played IF before. It introduces the common commands and mindset of text adventures, one step at a time. There’s an extensive help system describing standard IF commands, as well as dynamic hints which pop up whenever you seem to be stuck. <br> <br>I’ve tried to create a game which rewards many species of adventurer: the inexperienced newcomer, the puzzle-hurdler, the casual tourist, the meticulous explorer, the wild experimenter, the seeker after nuances and implications."},"contacts":{"url":"https://eblong.com/zarf/if.html#dreamhold"},"ifdb":{"tuid":"3myqnrs64nbtwdaz","pageversion":18,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=3myqnrs64nbtwdaz","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=3myqnrs64nbtwdaz&version=18"},"playTimeInMinutes":230,"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fzcode%2Fdreamhold.z8","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/zcode/dreamhold.z8","playOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fzcode%2Fdreamhold.z8","title":"dreamhold.z8","isGame":true,"format":"zcode"},{"url":"https://eblong.com/zarf/ftp/dreamhold-frotz.zip","title":"Windows game package","desc":"Z-code game file together with the Windows Frotz interpreter","format":"executable","os":"windows-frotz.","compression":"zip","compressedPr